{"id":4009,"date":"2023-10-06T10:20:18","date_gmt":"2023-10-06T09:20:18","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=4009"},"modified":"2024-12-10T12:23:16","modified_gmt":"2024-12-10T12:23:16","slug":"stem-educator-bren-hellier-joins-ccac-expansion-programme","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/stem-educator-bren-hellier-joins-ccac-expansion-programme\/","title":{"rendered":"Stem educator Bren Hellier joins CCAC Expansion Programme"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Bren-Hellier.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4019 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 876px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 876\/493;width:876px;height:493px\" width=\"876\" height=\"493\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Bren-Hellier.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Bren-Hellier-300x169.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Bren-Hellier-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Bren-Hellier-768x432.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Bren-Hellier-1536x864.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Bren-Hellier-2048x1152.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Bren-Hellier-356x200.jpg 356w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2023\/10\/Bren-Hellier-200x113.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 876px) 100vw, 876px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We welcome primary educator, Bren Hellier, to CCAC. She will be working alongside the co-design teams as we embark on our 2023-26 scaling stage. Eight schools are already underway.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">It can be daunting for the uninitiated to engage with a class of expectant nine and ten-year olds and their teachers, so Bren will be helping our designers to prepare their courses, sit in on some of their sessions, review the results, and offer advice.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Designers come to us brimming with ideas about ways they can project their discipline into a future of challenging climate change. Bren\u2019s expertise guides them to translate their professional vision into age-appropriate stimulating classroom activities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Bren will bracket each co-design collaboration with a simple student and teacher base and endline survey. Findings will refine and improve our ongoing programme.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We welcome primary educator, Bren Hellier, to CCAC, who will be working alongside the co-design teams.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":4019,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[12],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-4009","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-ccac-news"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Stem educator Bren Hellier joins CCAC Expansion Programme - Climate Change All Change<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/stem-educator-bren-hellier-joins-ccac-expansion-programme\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_GB\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Stem educator Bren Hellier joins CCAC Expansion Pro